{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"稻盛和夫·思想与方法","stage":"DONE","category":"kazuo-inamori","categoryLabel":"稻盛和夫","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/10_kazuo-inamori/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"思想与方法\">思想与方法</h1><p>本卷系统梳理稻盛和夫（1932—2022）的核心思想与可操作方法——从诊断成败的&quot;人生方程式&quot;，到&quot;敬天爱人&quot;&quot;作为人何谓正确&quot;&quot;利他之心&quot;等判断基准，再到&quot;六项精进&quot;&quot;燃烧的斗魂&quot;等每日修行之道。三者层层递进：方程式给出<strong>为什么</strong>，判断基准给出<strong>做什么才对</strong>，精进与斗魂给出<strong>如何持续做到</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟卷的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟卷的分工</h2><p>本卷只讲&quot;思想内核与方法论本身&quot;，刻意与兄弟卷划清边界，同一事实只在主篇展开、其余处交叉链接：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本卷（思想与方法）：方程式、敬天爱人、利他、六项精进、斗魂的<strong>原理与结构</strong>。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>：京瓷创立、第二电电、日航重建的<strong>史实经过</strong>（本卷只引用为例证）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>：阿米巴经营、京瓷哲学手册等<strong>制度化成果</strong>（思想如何落地为管理体系）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>：《活法》等书的<strong>文本与成书背景</strong>。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>：对&quot;心态决定命运&quot;&quot;股东 vs 员工优先&quot;&quot;跨文化适用性&quot;的<strong>批评与辩论</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[人生方程式] --&gt; B[思维方式的力量]&#10;    B --&gt; C[利他之心]&#10;    C --&gt; D[敬天爱人/何谓正确]&#10;    D --&gt; E[六项精进]&#10;    E --&gt; F[燃烧的斗魂]\">flowchart LR\n    A[人生方程式] --&gt; B[思维方式的力量]\n    B --&gt; C[利他之心]\n    C --&gt; D[敬天爱人/何谓正确]\n    D --&gt; E[六项精进]\n    E --&gt; F[燃烧的斗魂]</pre><ol>\n<li>先读<a href=\"the-life-equation/thinking-passion-ability\">人生方程式</a>与<a href=\"the-life-equation/the-power-of-mindset\">思维方式的力量</a>，建立&quot;思维方式权重最高&quot;的总框架。</li>\n<li>再读<a href=\"respect-heaven-love-people/altruism-as-principle\">利他之心</a>与<a href=\"respect-heaven-love-people/what-is-right-as-human-being\">敬天爱人与何谓正确</a>，理解&quot;正确思维方式&quot;的具体判断基准。</li>\n<li>最后读<a href=\"six-practices-and-spirit/the-six-endeavors\">六项精进</a>与<a href=\"six-practices-and-spirit/burning-fighting-spirit\">燃烧的斗魂</a>，掌握把理念维持在正向的日常方法与意志支撑。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>无硬性前置；若先浏览<a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>了解京瓷（1959）、第二电电（1984）、日航重建（2010）三段经历，会更易体会各篇引用的实例。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-life-equation","title":"人生与工作的方程式","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/the-life-equation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thinking-passion-ability","title":"人生方程式：思维方式×热情×能力","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/the-life-equation/thinking-passion-ability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-power-of-mindset","title":"思维方式的力量","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/the-life-equation/the-power-of-mindset"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"respect-heaven-love-people","title":"敬天爱人与利他","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/respect-heaven-love-people","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"altruism-as-principle","title":"利他之心","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/respect-heaven-love-people/altruism-as-principle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-is-right-as-human-being","title":"敬天爱人与作为人何谓正确","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/respect-heaven-love-people/what-is-right-as-human-being"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"six-practices-and-spirit","title":"六项精进与斗魂","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/six-practices-and-spirit","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-six-endeavors","title":"六项精进","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/six-practices-and-spirit/the-six-endeavors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"burning-fighting-spirit","title":"燃烧的斗魂","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/ideas-and-methods/six-practices-and-spirit/burning-fighting-spirit"}]}]}